### TripUpdater Mini-API — sample requests

@host = http://localhost:5156

### List trips (optionally filtered by lineNo, from, to)
GET {{host}}/trips
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{host}}/trips?lineNo=1
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{host}}/trips?lineNo=1&from=2026-07-29T08:00:00Z&to=2026-07-29T09:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

###

### Process a batch of trip updates
POST {{host}}/updates/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "updates": [
    { "tripId": 1001, "actualArrivalTime": "2026-07-29T08:31:00+00:00" },
    { "tripId": 1002, "actualArrivalTime": "2026-07-29T08:40:00+00:00" },
    { "tripId": 1003, "actualArrivalTime": null },
    { "tripId": 9999, "actualArrivalTime": "2026-07-29T08:30:00+00:00" }
  ]
}

###

### List update logs (optionally filtered by from, to, status)
GET {{host}}/updatelogs
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{host}}/updatelogs?status=Ontime
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{host}}/updatelogs?from=2026-07-29T00:00:00Z&to=2026-07-30T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json
